
<h1>The Core Library</h1>

<p>Here is a short description of the core library, which is
distributed with the system.
It provides a set of modules directly available
through the <tt>Require Import</tt> command.</p>

<p>The core library is composed of the following subdirectories:</p>

<dl>
  <dt> <b>Init</b>:
    The prelude (automatically loaded when starting Coq)
  </dt>
  <dd>
    theories/Init/PreludeOptions.v
    theories/Init/Typeclasses.v
    theories/Init/Notations.v
    theories/Init/Types/Decimal.v
    theories/Init/Types/Ascii.v
    theories/Init/Types/Relations.v
    theories/Init/Types/String.v
    theories/Init/Types/Unit.v
    theories/Init/Types/Number.v
    theories/Init/Types/Bool.v
    theories/Init/Types/Sum.v
    theories/Init/Types/Option.v
    theories/Init/Types/Wf.v
    theories/Init/Types/Byte.v
    theories/Init/Types/Box.v
    theories/Init/Types/Comparison.v
    theories/Init/Types/Equality.v
    theories/Init/Types/Sigma.v
    theories/Init/Types/Hexadecimal.v
    theories/Init/Types/Functions.v
    theories/Init/Types/Empty.v
    theories/Init/Types/List.v
    theories/Init/Types/Nat.v
    theories/Init/Types.v
    theories/Init/Classes.v
    theories/Init/GroupoidOperations.v
    theories/Init/Tactics/Extra.v
    theories/Init/Tactics/Tauto.v
    theories/Init/Tactics/Ltac.v
    (theories/Init/Prelude.v)
  </dd>

  <dt> <b>Properties of basic types</b> </dt>
  <dd>
    theories/Properties/Decimal.v
    theories/Properties/Number.v
    theories/Properties/GroupoidLaws.v
    theories/Properties/Bool.v
    theories/Properties/Sum.v
    theories/Properties/Equivalence.v
    theories/Properties/Peano.v
    theories/Properties/SortPolyPaper.v
    theories/Properties/Byte.v
    theories/Properties/Comparison.v
    theories/Properties/Hexadecimal.v
    theories/Properties/NumberNotations.v
    theories/Properties/Functions.v
    theories/Properties/List.v
    theories/Properties/Nat.v
  </dd>

  <dt> <b>Binary numbers</b>:
    Basic definitions of binary arithmetic
  </dt>
  <dd>
    theories/Numbers/BinNums.v
    theories/BinNums/PosDef.v
    theories/BinNums/NatDef.v
    theories/BinNums/IntDef.v
  </dd>

  <dt> <b>Cyclic</b>:
    63-bits-based cyclic arithmetic
  </dt>
  <dd>
    theories/Numbers/Cyclic/Int63/CarryType.v
    theories/Numbers/Cyclic/Int63/PrimInt63.v
    theories/Numbers/Cyclic/Int63/Uint63Axioms.v
    theories/Numbers/Cyclic/Int63/Sint63Axioms.v
  </dd>

  <dt> <b>Floats</b>:
    Floating-point arithmetic
  </dt>
  <dd>
    theories/Floats/FloatClass.v
    theories/Floats/PrimFloat.v
    theories/Floats/SpecFloat.v
    theories/Floats/FloatOps.v
    theories/Floats/FloatAxioms.v
  </dd>

  <dt> <b>Classes</b>:
  </dt>
  <dd>
    theories/Classes/Morphisms.v
    theories/Classes/Morphisms_Prop.v
    theories/Classes/Equivalence.v
    theories/Classes/ProperTactics.v
    theories/Classes/Tactics.v
